    "detailed_description": "After leaving the portal you are taken HOME. Home of origin will require you to seal off entities linked from escape portal. It will not take long for them to follow back, and thus opening the doorway for MR 333. Failure to complete the ritual you embarked on will open your home to the being and his entities wish to ensure this happens. The only way to seal off and continue the ritual is to birth a prison planet in their realm, a place where the vibrations can hold them and not give them reign in yours. Become pregnant, birth a planet and seal off the entities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMR 333 II: Planetbirth features a first person perspective with frantic gameplay requiring you to locate items, fight entities and run from enemies existing in your realm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNavigate the house after returning &quot;Home&quot; and explore the surrounding areas. Rebuke entities and run from those corrupted. Become pregnant with the planetary fertile snake and fight the entities through each trimester.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a small sequel to MR 333 that features an additional level to take place directly after the completion of the ritual from the previous game.",
